<hr data-start=3D"2407" data-end=3D"2410">
<h3 data-start=3D"2412" data-end=3D"2437">=F0=9F=94=B9 Backend Techniques</=
h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"2439" data-end=3D"2465">A. Cache Aggressively</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"2466" data-end=3D"2616">
<li data-start=3D"2466" data-end=3D"2519">
<p data-start=3D"2468" data-end=3D"2519">Lookups rarely change =E2=86=92 ca=
che in Redis / Caffeine</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2520" data-end=3D"2582">
<p data-start=3D"2522" data-end=3D"2548">Separate cache per module:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2551" data-end=3D"2582">
<li data-start=3D"2551" data-end=3D"2582">
<p data-start=3D"2553" data-end=3D"2582">Countries, roles, permissions</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2583" data-end=3D"2616">
<p data-start=3D"2585" data-end=3D"2616">TTL 1=E2=80=9324h, invalidate on c=
hange</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"2618" data-end=3D"2643">B. Parallel Fetching</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"2644" data-end=3D"2736">
<li data-start=3D"2644" data-end=3D"2683">
<p data-start=3D"2646" data-end=3D"2683">Already using <code data-start=3D"=
2660" data-end=3D"2681">StructuredTaskScope</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2684" data-end=3D"2736">
<p data-start=3D"2686" data-end=3D"2736">Ensures CPU/microservice latency i=
s not sequential</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"2738" data-end=3D"2766">C. Response Compression</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"2767" data-end=3D"2847">
<li data-start=3D"2767" data-end=3D"2792">
<p data-start=3D"2769" data-end=3D"2792">Enable GZIP or Brotli</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2793" data-end=3D"2847">
<p data-start=3D"2795" data-end=3D"2847">Lookups JSON can be hundreds of KB=
 =E2=86=92 compress 70=E2=80=9380%</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"2849" data-end=3D"2875">D. CDN / Edge Caching</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"2876" data-end=3D"2999">
<li data-start=3D"2876" data-end=3D"2941">
<p data-start=3D"2878" data-end=3D"2941"><code data-start=3D"2878" data-end=
=3D"2890">/bootstrap</code> is mostly static per version =E2=86=92 cache at=
 CDN edge</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2942" data-end=3D"2999">
<p data-start=3D"2944" data-end=3D"2952">Example:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2955" data-end=3D"2999">
<li data-start=3D"2955" data-end=3D"2999">
<p data-start=3D"2957" data-end=3D"2999"><code data-start=3D"2957" data-end=
=3D"2980">/bootstrap?version=3D42</code> =E2=86=92 cache for 1 hour</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"3001" data-end=3D"3041">E. Versioning / Immutable Respons=
es</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3042" data-end=3D"3126">
<li data-start=3D"3042" data-end=3D"3064">
<p data-start=3D"3044" data-end=3D"3064">Version the response</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3065" data-end=3D"3126">
<p data-start=3D"3067" data-end=3D"3126">CDN caches versioned URL =E2=86=92=
 cache hits increase dramatically</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"3128" data-end=3D"3154">F. Horizontal Scaling</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3155" data-end=3D"3235">
<li data-start=3D"3155" data-end=3D"3197">
<p data-start=3D"3157" data-end=3D"3197">Scale <code data-start=3D"3163" da=
ta-end=3D"3175">/bootstrap</code> service independently</p>
