<p data-start=3D"3287" data-end=3D"3348">Use Kafka/RabbitMQ to update cache=
 when internal data changes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3349" data-end=3D"3390">
<p data-start=3D"3351" data-end=3D"3390">Reduces load during high-traffic s=
pikes</p>
</li>
</ul>
