<hr data-start=3D"3036" data-end=3D"3039">
<h2 data-start=3D"3041" data-end=3D"3080">=F0=9F=94=B9 Key Design Principle=
s Illustrated</h2>
<ol data-start=3D"3082" data-end=3D"3964">
<li data-start=3D"3082" data-end=3D"3248">
<p data-start=3D"3085" data-end=3D"3114"><strong data-start=3D"3085" data-e=
nd=3D"3114">Internal vs External DTOs</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3118" data-end=3D"3248">
<li data-start=3D"3118" data-end=3D"3151">
<p data-start=3D"3120" data-end=3D"3151">Microservices =E2=86=92 internal D=
TOs</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3155" data-end=3D"3208">
<p data-start=3D"3157" data-end=3D"3208"><code data-start=3D"3157" data-end=
=3D"3169">/bootstrap</code> / BFF =E2=86=92 maps to external DTOs for UI</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3212" data-end=3D"3248">
<p data-start=3D"3214" data-end=3D"3248">Mappers are single source of truth=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3250" data-end=3D"3415">
<p data-start=3D"3253" data-end=3D"3282"><strong data-start=3D"3253" data-e=
nd=3D"3282">Single <code data-start=3D"3262" data-end=3D"3274">/bootstrap</=
code> Entry</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3286" data-end=3D"3415">
<li data-start=3D"3286" data-end=3D"3320">
<p data-start=3D"3288" data-end=3D"3320">Shell fetches once per session</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3324" data-end=3D"3357">
<p data-start=3D"3326" data-end=3D"3357">Frontend MFs read cached data</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3361" data-end=3D"3415">
<p data-start=3D"3363" data-end=3D"3415">Parallel fetching in backend ensur=
es minimal latency</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3417" data-end=3D"3588">
<p data-start=3D"3420" data-end=3D"3440"><strong data-start=3D"3420" data-e=
nd=3D"3440">Scalable Caching</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3444" data-end=3D"3588">
<li data-start=3D"3444" data-end=3D"3492">
<p data-start=3D"3446" data-end=3D"3492">Lookups cached internally (Caffein=
e / Redis)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3496" data-end=3D"3544">
<p data-start=3D"3498" data-end=3D"3544">Versioned responses allow CDN / ed=
ge caching</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3548" data-end=3D"3588">
<p data-start=3D"3550" data-end=3D"3588">ETag prevents unnecessary re-downl=
oads</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3590" data-end=3D"3750">
<p data-start=3D"3593" data-end=3D"3623"><strong data-start=3D"3593" data-e=
nd=3D"3623">Microfrontends Integration</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3627" data-end=3D"3750">
<li data-start=3D"3627" data-end=3D"3660">
<p data-start=3D"3629" data-end=3D"3660">Each MF module is lazy-loaded</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3664" data-end=3D"3719">
<p data-start=3D"3666" data-end=3D"3719">Reads global state for lookups / u=
ser / permissions</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3723" data-end=3D"3750">
<p data-start=3D"3725" data-end=3D"3750">No repeated network calls</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3752" data-end=3D"3964">
<p data-start=3D"3755" data-end=3D"3781"><strong data-start=3D"3755" data-e=
nd=3D"3781">Optional BFF Migration</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"3785" data-end=3D"3964">
<li data-start=3D"3785" data-end=3D"3831">
<p data-start=3D"3787" data-end=3D"3831">Frontend calls BFF instead of <cod=
e data-start=3D"3817" data-end=3D"3829">/bootstrap</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3835" data-end=3D"3871">
<p data-start=3D"3837" data-end=3D"3871">BFF aggregates multiple services</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3875" data-end=3D"3924">
<p data-start=3D"3877" data-end=3D"3924">Uses the same internal =E2=86=92 e=
xternal DTO mapping</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3928" data-end=3D"3964">
<p data-start=3D"3930" data-end=3D"3964">No rewrite of microservices needed=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"3966" data-end=3D"3969">
<h2 data-start=3D"3971" data-end=3D"4010">=F0=9F=94=B9 Scaling <code data-s=
tart=3D"3985" data-end=3D"3997">/bootstrap</code> for Millions</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"4012" data-end=3D"4295">
<li data-start=3D"4012" data-end=3D"4044">
<p data-start=3D"4014" data-end=3D"4044"><strong data-start=3D"4014" data-e=
nd=3D"4042">Cache lookups per module</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4045" data-end=3D"4088">
<p data-start=3D"4047" data-end=3D"4088"><strong data-start=3D"4047" data-e=
nd=3D"4065">Parallel fetch</strong> of all data sections</p>
